        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Help Extend Auditory Relief Act of 2025 or the HEAR Act of 2025</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>This bill provides for Medicare coverage of hearing aids and hearing rehabilitation services. Covered services include hearing aid assessments, fittings, and related instructional services.</p>",
